$ python3 -B core/Montana-Core/protocol-13/network-run/run.py --dry-run --run-id DRYRUN
Protocol-13 item 13 -- the full network run DRYRUN, 2026-10-29 08:00:07 UTC (DRY RUN)
Our own reproduction on our own servers; not an independent external audit.
Every ssh below runs: python3 -I -c "import sys;d=sys.stdin.buffer.read();i=d.index(bytes(8));exec(compile(d[:i],'mt13-remote','exec'),{'DATA':d[i+8:]})"
with the executor REMOTE of run.py (sha256 8428dc6f14bdb821006a0371505318d1bacb4854e5eb173eaa8ce9876c4cf40f) and the listed operations on its standard input.

